	(descr "TI LM2940CT-5.0/LF01, TO-220 NDG0003F SMD formed-lead package - 3 gull-wing leads plus the exposed tab solder flat to the board, no through-holes. Land pattern read directly off TI lm2940c.pdf NDG0003F EXAMPLE BOARD LAYOUT (4219861/A p.43): 1.0x2.8mm lead pads at 2.54mm pitch; stepped thermal pad 8.32x5.81mm under the body then 10.16x6.35mm under the tab (12.16mm total); paste per p.44 stencil, 64 windows = 61%% coverage on the thermal pad. https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/lm2940c.pdf")
